 Why: The scheduler derives dependencies, transfers, lifetimes, and reuse only from checked access and completion facts; an unresolved alias or completion would make execution unsafe.
 Fix: Preserve source order, declare the complete resource access, or provide the real completion event before requesting parallel execution.
